---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Reference: co u&zcaron; b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute; | ALSflow"
  description="Weby, software a AI asistenti, kter&eacute; jsou &zcaron;iv&eacute; a d&aacute; se na n&ecaron; prokliknout. Co p&rcaron;esn&ecaron; jsem d&ecaron;lal a co ne."
  canonical="https://alsflow.cz/reference"
  ogTitle="Reference: co u&zcaron; b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute;"
  ogDescription="&Zcaron;iv&eacute; weby, software a asistenti. U ka&zcaron;d&eacute; polo&zcaron;ky pí&scaron;u, co bylo moje a co ne."
  current="/reference"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "url": "https://alsflow.cz/reference",
  "name": "Reference ALSflow",
  "description": "Weby, software a AI asistenti postavené ALSflow, které jsou v provozu.",
  "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "url": "https://alsflow.cz" }
}
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="hero hero-plain">
    <canvas class="scene scene-right" data-scene="dotmatrix" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><i class="a1"></i><i class="a2"></i></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow-label">Reference</span>
      <h1 class="h-hero fade-head reveal-words" style="max-width:16ch">Co u&zcaron; <span class="grad">b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute;</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">V&scaron;echno n&iacute;&zcaron;e je &zcaron;iv&eacute; a d&aacute; se na to prokliknout. U ka&zcaron;d&eacute; polo&zcaron;ky p&iacute;&scaron;u,
        co p&rcaron;esn&ecaron; bylo moje a co ne, v&ccaron;etn&ecaron; toho, kde jsem d&ecaron;lal jen &ccaron;&aacute;st. Je toho zat&iacute;m tolik,
        kolik toho je: za&ccaron;&iacute;n&aacute;m a nebudu p&rcaron;edst&iacute;rat portfolio pln&eacute; log.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WEBY -->
  <section class="sec sec-line scene-host" id="weby">
    <canvas class="scene scene-soft" data-scene="lines" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow-label">Weby</span>
        <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Dva weby <span class="grad">od za&ccaron;&aacute;tku do konce</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">N&aacute;vrh, texty, k&oacute;d, nasazen&iacute; i dom&eacute;na. Oba d&aacute;l spravuju.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards-2">
        <div class="rev">
          <a class="panel panel-glow panel-sheen tilt" href="https://gen1.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="panel-media"><img src="/assets/ref/gen1-desktop.jpg" alt="&Uacute;vodn&iacute; str&aacute;nka webu gen1.cz" width="1080" height="675" loading="lazy" /></div>
          </a>
          <div class="panel-foot">
            <h3>gen1.cz</h3>
            <p class="ref-who">Politick&eacute; hnut&iacute; &middot; Praha 1</p>
            <p>Jeden&aacute;ct str&aacute;nek: program, kandid&aacute;tka, p&rcaron;ihla&scaron;ovac&iacute; formul&aacute;&rcaron;.
              Aktuality si hnut&iacute; p&iacute;&scaron;e samo p&rcaron;es vlastn&iacute; editor, bez redak&ccaron;n&iacute;ho syst&eacute;mu.
              Sou&ccaron;&aacute;st&iacute; je i povinn&eacute; ozna&ccaron;en&iacute; volebn&iacute; agitace.</p>
            <p class="ref-mine"><b>Moje:</b> cel&yacute; web.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rev" data-d="1">
          <a class="panel panel-glow panel-sheen tilt" href="https://znalecsekelova.sk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="panel-media"><img src="/assets/ref/sekelova-desktop.jpg" alt="&Uacute;vodn&iacute; str&aacute;nka webu znalecsekelova.sk" width="1080" height="675" loading="lazy" /></div>
          </a>
          <div class="panel-foot">
            <h3>znalecsekelova.sk</h3>
            <p class="ref-who">Soudn&iacute; znalkyn&ecaron; &middot; Slovensko</p>
            <p>Osm str&aacute;nek slovensky: slu&zcaron;by, cen&iacute;k, podklady k obhl&iacute;dce.
              Kresby jsou vlastn&iacute;, d&ecaron;lan&eacute; p&rcaron;&iacute;mo v SVG. Plynul&eacute; rolov&aacute;n&iacute;
              a &zcaron;&aacute;dn&aacute; cookie li&scaron;ta, proto&zcaron;e web nic nesleduje.</p>
            <p class="ref-mine"><b>Moje:</b> cel&yacute; web.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOFTWARE A ASISTENTI -->
  <section class="sec sec-dark sec-line" id="software">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow-label">Software a asistenti</span>
        <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Placen&aacute; zak&aacute;zka pro <span class="grad">cizí firmu</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">Tady u&zcaron; nejde o web, ale o to, co na n&ecaron;m b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute;.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-pad panel-glow rev ref-big">
        <h3>We Love Events</h3>
        <p class="ref-who">Event agentura a p&uring;j&ccaron;ovna techniky &middot; Praha</p>

        <p>Pra&zcaron;sk&aacute; agentura, kter&aacute; d&ecaron;l&aacute; produkci akc&iacute; a p&uring;j&ccaron;uje ozvu&ccaron;en&iacute;,
          sv&ecaron;tla, LED st&ecaron;ny a p&oacute;dia. Web u&zcaron; m&ecaron;li. Chyb&ecaron;lo jim to, co na n&ecaron;m m&aacute; d&ecaron;lat pr&aacute;ci.</p>

        <ul class="ref-list">
          <li>
            <b>P&uring;j&ccaron;ovna</b>
            <span>Katalog techniky, ko&scaron;&iacute;k a popt&aacute;vkov&yacute; formul&aacute;&rcaron;. Z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k si naklik&aacute;
              sestavu a ode&scaron;le ji jedn&iacute;m tla&ccaron;&iacute;tkem, m&iacute;sto aby psal e-mail se seznamem.
              &Ccaron;esky i anglicky.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Jack</b>
            <span>Asistent, kter&yacute; odpov&iacute;d&aacute; z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k&uring;m na dotazy ke katalogu: co je
              skladem, co se k &ccaron;emu hod&iacute;, hled&aacute;n&iacute; podle s&eacute;riov&eacute;ho &ccaron;&iacute;sla.
              Kdy&zcaron; si nev&iacute; rady nebo je hovor nep&rcaron;&iacute;jemn&yacute;, p&rcaron;ed&aacute; ho &ccaron;lov&ecaron;ku.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="ref-mine"><b>Moje:</b> p&uring;j&ccaron;ovna a Jack.
          <b class="ref-not">Nen&iacute; moje:</b> samotn&yacute; web weloveevents.cz, ten stav&ecaron;l n&ecaron;kdo p&rcaron;ede mnou.
          Dneska ho spravuju.</p>

        <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="https://weloveevents.cz/rental" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Otev&rcaron;&iacute;t p&uring;j&ccaron;ovnu &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TENHLE WEB -->
  <section class="sec sec-line" id="alsflow">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow-label">A tenhle web</span>
        <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Kl&aacute;ra sed&iacute; <span class="grad">vpravo dole</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">alsflow.cz je taky uk&aacute;zka. Postaven&yacute; stejn&ecaron; jako to, co prod&aacute;v&aacute;m:
          ru&ccaron;n&ecaron; psan&yacute;, bez redak&ccaron;n&iacute;ho syst&eacute;mu, bez plugin&uring;. Kl&aacute;ra v rohu je
          ten sam&yacute; asistent, jak&eacute;ho stav&iacute;m klient&uring;m, jen napln&ecaron;n&yacute; podklady o ALSflow.
          M&uring;&zcaron;ete si ji rovnou vyzkou&scaron;et.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec-dark">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
      <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Chcete b&yacute;t <span class="grad">dal&scaron;&iacute;</span>?</h2>
      <p class="lead lead-center rev" data-d="1">Nez&aacute;vazn&yacute; hovor na &ccaron;tvrt hodiny.
        Dostanete pevnou cenu a term&iacute;n, ne odhad.</p>
      <div class="btn-row rev" data-d="2" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-grad btn-shine" href="/kontakt">Nez&aacute;vazn&aacute; nab&iacute;dka</a>
        <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/cenik">Cen&iacute;k</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Fragment slot="tail">
  <style>
    .ref-who {
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--t3);
    }

    /* Kdo co delal. Nejdulezitejsi radek na cele strance: bez nej by
       ctenar predpokladal, ze je moje uplne vsechno, co je na obrazku. */
    .ref-mine {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
      padding-top: 0.8rem;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--t2);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .ref-mine b { color: var(--green); }
    .ref-mine .ref-not { color: var(--t3); }

    .ref-big { max-width: 54rem; }
    .ref-big h3 { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.7rem); }
    .ref-big > p { margin-top: 0.7rem; color: var(--t2); }

    .ref-list {
      margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .ref-list li {
      padding-left: 1rem;
      border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 45%, transparent);
    }
    .ref-list b { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .ref-list span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.62;
      color: var(--t2);
    }
    .ref-big .btn { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  </style>
  </Fragment>
</Base>
